Always use JSON files for complex operations rather than inline strings

Validate JSON before sending to ACLI (use jq or similar)

Store templates for common story types to speed up creation

Use descriptive summaries with prefixes (DB:, API:, UI:, etc.)

Link to epics using parentIssueId to maintain organization

Include context in descriptions using ADF headings and lists

Check for errors after each creation and handle failures gracefully

Clean up test stories after successful automation

